'''Shearwater Bridge''' is a long, stone bridge that connects the Valley and [[Grampleton Fields]]. The bridge leads east towards Grampleton, west toward Pelican Town, and southwest to [[Old Community Garden]]. 

According to [[Victor]], the bridge was built forty years prior to the Farmer moving to Stardew Valley.

At level 5 fishing, Shearwater Bridge is a decent source of early game money from the [[Butterfish]] and [[Puppyfish]] spawns. 

== Forage ==
Between 1 and 3 forageable items spawn at Shearwater Bridge per day. They do not last for a week like original maps.
